# Schedules for the scheduler container (supercronic, standard cron syntax, UTC).
# Collectors are added here as they land; each one fetches any days it missed.

# Every hour: confirm the database and object storage are reachable.
0 * * * * dr check

# Every day at 04:30 UTC: SEAP direct purchases finalized up to yesterday.
30 4 * * * dr collect seap-direct

# Every day at 05:30 UTC: SEAP award notices published up to yesterday, with the
# contracts and winners of each (one request per notice, a few minutes a day).
30 5 * * * dr collect seap-awards
